WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.059 --> 00:00:02.635
-Guys, before we go on, I'd like
to take a moment to thank

00:00:02.635 --> 00:00:05.004
some of our sponsors
for tonight's show.

00:00:05.004 --> 00:00:07.207
They don't always fit
in the commercial breaks,

00:00:07.207 --> 00:00:09.241
and we want to make sure that we
mention all of them.

00:00:09.241 --> 00:00:11.210
So, it's time for
"Tonight Show Sponsors."

00:00:11.210 --> 00:00:14.814
Here we go.
-♪ Tonight show sponsors ♪

00:00:14.814 --> 00:00:17.450
♪ Tonight show sponsors ♪

00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:19.652
[ Applause ]

00:00:19.652 --> 00:00:20.987
-AMC Theaters.

00:00:20.987 --> 00:00:22.288
You thought we'd clean
the floors

00:00:22.288 --> 00:00:23.523
in the last year and a half?

00:00:23.523 --> 00:00:24.790
Think again.

00:00:24.790 --> 00:00:28.027
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:28.027 --> 00:00:29.362
Sunglass Hut.

00:00:29.362 --> 00:00:31.898
Your second favorite "Hut"-based
establishment.

00:00:31.898 --> 00:00:35.468
[ Laughter and applause

00:00:35.468 --> 00:00:36.469
The Olympics.

00:00:36.469 --> 00:00:38.071
Well, well, well,
look who's finally

00:00:38.071 --> 00:00:39.706
signing up for Peacock.

00:00:39.706 --> 00:00:43.176
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:43.176 --> 00:00:44.477
White Claw.

00:00:44.477 --> 00:00:46.913
Find out what you did tonight
on TikTok tomorrow.

00:00:46.913 --> 00:00:51.050
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:52.218
Little Caesars.

00:00:52.218 --> 00:00:54.287
If we can make a pizza
for you in five minutes,

00:00:54.287 --> 00:00:56.088
maybe question
what's going on here.

00:00:56.088 --> 00:00:58.591
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:02.261
Toblerone.

00:01:02.261 --> 00:01:05.097
Why yes, I was just at
an airport duty-free store.

00:01:05.097 --> 00:01:06.565
Why do you ask?

00:01:06.565 --> 00:01:09.002
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:10.969 --> 00:01:12.305
The Hallmark Channel.

00:01:12.305 --> 00:01:14.007
We know it's July,
but somebody's gotta

00:01:14.007 --> 00:01:15.608
fall in love
with Santa Claus.

00:01:15.608 --> 00:01:19.579
[ Applause ]

00:01:19.579 --> 00:01:20.680
Johnson &amp; Johnson.

00:01:20.680 --> 00:01:22.115
Fine, okay, we'll just stick

00:01:22.115 --> 00:01:23.716
to baby shampoo from now on.

00:01:23.716 --> 00:01:25.985
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:28.587 --> 00:01:29.722
Pandora.

00:01:29.722 --> 00:01:31.791
Enjoy having your favorite music
interrupted

00:01:31.791 --> 00:01:34.594
by an incredibly loud ad
for Tide!

00:01:34.594 --> 00:01:38.764
[ Applause ]

00:01:38.764 --> 00:01:39.832
MTV.

00:01:39.832 --> 00:01:41.700
Yes, we still think
"Ridiculousness"

00:01:41.700 --> 00:01:43.336
is going to take off.

00:01:43.336 --> 00:01:46.772
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:46.772 --> 00:01:48.775
And finally, Costco.

00:01:48.775 --> 00:01:51.044
You'll die before you finish
this tub of ketchup.

00:01:51.044 --> 00:01:52.512
[ Laughter ]

00:01:52.512 --> 00:01:54.280
That's all
for "Tonight Show Sponsors."

